  "body": "Brand new and thoughtfully designed, this impressive Gulf Harbour residence combines modern luxury, everyday convenience and effortless indoor-outdoor living. Set in the heart of sought-after Gulf Harbour, this beautifully presented home offers a practical and versatile layout designed to accommodate families, guests and multi-generational living with ease.\r\n\r\nStep inside to discover four generous bedrooms, and three-and-a-half bathrooms, including two private ensuites. With plenty of room for everyone to spread out, the home delivers both connection and privacy.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the property is a stylish open-plan kitchen, dining and main living area, creating an inviting hub for everyday life and entertaining. Large openings provide seamless flow outdoors to the entertaining deck and landscaped grounds — an ideal setting for relaxed gatherings, weekend barbecues or enjoying a quiet morning coffee.\r\n\r\nThe two living areas provide exceptional flexibility, whether you need a dedicated family room, a children's retreat, a media space or simply somewhere peaceful to unwind.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n• Brand-new, masterfully built residence\r\n• Four generous bedrooms\r\n• Three-and-a-half bathrooms\r\n• Two private ensuites\r\n• Two separate living areas\r\n• Stylish open-plan kitchen, gas cooking\r\n• Excellent indoor-outdoor flow\r\n• Entertaining deck and landscaped grounds\r\n• Central air conditioning\r\n• Quality finishes throughout\r\n• Double internal-access garage\r\n• Flexible layout ideal for families, guests or multi-generational living\r\n\r\nA Location That Delivers\r\nEnjoy the best of Gulf Harbour living with Gulf Harbour Marina, beautiful beaches, excellent schools, cafés and restaurants all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nThe nearby ferry terminal also provides a convenient option for commuting to Auckland CBD, making this an appealing choice for those seeking a relaxed coastal lifestyle without sacrificing connectivity.\r\n\r\nBrand new, beautifully appointed and exceptionally versatile — 32 Ta Moko Drive is ready to welcome you home.\r\n\r\nEnquire today to discover everything this exceptional Gulf Harbour residence has to offer.",
